<h1>JWT Dashboard</h1>
<p>Send your token to <code>GET /api/test</code> using the <code>Authorization: Bearer</code> header.</p>
<form id="token-form">
    <label for="token-field">JSON Web Token</label>
    <textarea id="token-field" rows="8" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" required></textarea>
    <button type="submit">Get Secure Information</button>
</form>
<p>Tokens expire after one hour. JWT contents are readable; the signature protects them from changes.</p>
<pre id="api-result" aria-live="polite" hidden></pre>
